<title>HUNGARY: GRABOPLAST SEES '97 GROUP SALES UP TO HUF 22.45BLN.</title>
<headline>GRABOPLAST SEES '97 GROUP SALES UP TO HUF 22.45BLN.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian home improvement product maker group Graboplast said on Thursday it expected to its consolidated sales revenues to rise to 22.45 billion forints in 1997 from 15.21 billion in 1996.</p>
<p>The group's operating profit was expected to rise to 2.18 billion forints in 1997 from 1.89 billion in 1996, the group's Chairman and General Director Peter Jancso told a news conference.</p>
<p>Graboplast's pre-tax profit was seen rising to 2.09 billion forints this year from 1.76 billion in 1996, he said.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
